      "id": "c-example-011",
      "language": "c",
      "type": "c",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "beginner",
      "title": "示例 011：else if 多分支",
      "summary": "成绩分档的经典写法。",
      "concepts": [
        "else if",
        "多分支",
        "区间判断",
        "标准：c17"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C 示例（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n\nint main(void) {\n    int score = 85;\n    if (score >= 90) {\n        printf(\"优秀\\n\");\n    } else if (score >= 75) {\n        printf(\"良好\\n\");\n    } else if (score >= 60) {\n        printf(\"及格\\n\");\n    } else {\n        printf(\"不及格\\n\");\n    }\n    return 0;\n}\n",
      "expectedOutput": "良好\n",
      "inputFixtures": {},
      "templateType": "c",
      "sourceLessonId": "c-tutorial-011-lesson"
    },
    {
      "id": "c-example-012",
      "language": "c",
      "type": "c",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "beginner",
      "title": "示例 012：switch 分支",
      "summary": "按整数或字符取值选择分支。",
      "concepts": [
        "switch",
        "case",
        "break",
        "default",
        "标准：c17"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C 示例（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n\nint main(void) {\n    char op = '*';\n    int a = 6, b = 7;\n    switch (op) {\n        case '+': printf(\"%d\\n\", a + b); break;\n        case '-': printf(\"%d\\n\", a - b); break;\n        case '*': printf(\"%d\\n\", a * b); break;\n        default: printf(\"unknown\\n\"); break;\n    }\n    return 0;\n}\n",
      "expectedOutput": "42\n",
      "inputFixtures": {},
      "templateType": "c",
      "sourceLessonId": "c-tutorial-012-lesson"
    },
