      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n\nint main(void) {\n    int values[] = {3, 0, 7, 0};\n    int i = 0;\n    do {\n        printf(\"value=%d\\n\", values[i]);\n        i++;\n    } while (i < 4 && values[i] != 0);\n    return 0;\n}\n",
