      "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n\nint main(void) {\n    for (int row = 1; row <= 3; row++) {\n        for (int col = 1; col <= 3; col++) {\n            printf(\"%d*%d=%d \", row, col, row * col);\n        }\n        printf(\"\\n\");\n    }\n    return 0;\n}\n",
