      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n\nint main(void) {\n    int n = 4;\n    for (int r = 1; r <= n; r++) {\n        for (int s = 0; s < n - r; s++) printf(\" \");\n        for (int c = 0; c < 2 * r - 1; c++) printf(\"*\");\n        printf(\"\\n\");\n    }\n    return 0;\n}\n",
      "expectedOutput": "   *\n  ***\n *****\n*******\n",
