      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "code": "#include <stdio.h>\n\nint counter = 0;\n\nvoid tick(void) {\n    int local = 100;\n    counter++;\n    printf(\"local=%d counter=%d\\n\", local, counter);\n}\n\nint main(void) {\n    tick();\n    tick();\n    printf(\"final counter=%d\\n\", counter);\n    return 0;\n}\n",
      "expectedOutput": "local=100 counter=1\nlocal=100 counter=2\nfinal counter=2\n",
