      "id": "c-example-093",
      "language": "c",
      "type": "c",
      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "advanced",
      "title": "示例 093：内存池/竞技场分配",
      "summary": "一次性申请大块，用完整体重置。",
      "concepts": [
        "arena",
        "内存池",
