      "title": "示例 094：异常安全保证",
      "summary": "区分基本/强/不抛异常保证，用 RAII 与 copy-and-swap 实现强保证。",
      "concepts": [
        "异常安全",
        "基本保证",
        "强保证",
        "copy-and-swap",
        "标准：c++20"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI C++ 示例（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11",
      "code": "#include <iostream>\n#include <string>\n#include <utility>\n\nclass Config {\npublic:\n    explicit Config(std::string name) : name_(std::move(name)) {}\n    Config& operator=(Config other) {  // 传值：先拷贝\n        swap(other);                   // 交换：不抛\n        return *this;\n    }\n    void swap(Config& other) noexcept { std::swap(name_, other.name_); }\n    const std::string& name() const { return name_; }\nprivate:\n    std::string name_;\n};\n\nint main() {\n    Config a(\"first\");\n    Config b(\"second\");\n    a = b;\n    std::cout << a.name() << \" \" << b.name() << \"\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}\n",
      "expectedOutput": "second second\n",
      "inputFixtures": {},
      "templateType": "cpp",
      "sourceLessonId": "cpp-tutorial-094-lesson"
    },
