      "locale": "zh-CN",
      "level": "advanced",
      "title": "示例 084：死锁与避免",
      "summary": "锁顺序不当会造成死锁，统一加锁顺序可避免。",
      "concepts": [
        "死锁",
        "锁顺序",
        "synchronized"
      ],
      "source": "QFLI Java 示例（原创）",
      "license": "Original QFLI curriculum. CC BY 4.0",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-09",
      "code": "public class Main {\n    static final Object LOCK_A = new Object();\n    static final Object LOCK_B = new Object();\n\n    static void transferAB() {\n        synchronized (LOCK_A) {\n            synchronized (LOCK_B) {\n                System.out.println(\"AB\");\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    static void transferBA() {\n        synchronized (LOCK_A) {\n            synchronized (LOCK_B) {\n                System.out.println(\"BA\");\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) throws InterruptedException {\n        Thread t1 = new Thread(Main::transferAB);\n        Thread t2 = new Thread(Main::transferBA);\n        t1.start();\n        t2.start();\n        t1.join();\n        t2.join();\n        System.out.println(\"finished\");\n    }\n}",
      "expectedOutput": "AB\nBA\nfinished",
      "inputFixtures": {},
      "templateType": "java",
      "sourceLessonId": "java-tutorial-084"
    },
